## Activation

**`Role: Legal`**, **`Role: Compliance`**, **`Роль: Юрист-комплаенс`**, **`Роль: Legal`**, `@role-legal-compliance`, subagent `muster-legal`.

1. **Read first:** `orchestration-queue.md` (эпик **Проект МТС**) → `@knowledge-base/mts-project/INDEX.md` → `@knowledge-base/mts-exolve-npa-registry.md` → `@knowledge-base/mts-exolve-antifraud-project-prep.md` → skill `@.claude/skills/npa-registry-legal.md`.
2. Claim one Legal task → `IN_PROGRESS`.
